  "body": "## What's Changed\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n### Enhancements\n\n### Other Changes\n* GitOps storage never loads when multiple repos appear at different times at startup (#10862)\n* OLM v0 cross-minor upgrade test grows with every release and exceeds the CI job timeout (#10860)\n* Maintenance-branch operator releases set the OLM catalog defaultChannel to the minor channel (#10843)\n\n"
